{
  "id": "INC-005",
  "title": "Upgraded plugin sends one-shot version sync notice to existing controller and deduplicates second turn",
  "incidentDate": "2026-11-23",
  "category": "hook",
  "description": "PreInvocation notifies an existing controller once after plugin upgrade, records flight event, and does not repeat on the next turn.",
  "kind": "hook",
  "setup": {
    "registryRelPath": ".agents/SESSION-REGISTRY.md",
    "registryMarkdown": "# 台账\n## 一、当前独占资源租约\n| 字段 | 当前值 |\n| --- | --- |\n| **锁状态** | `IDLE（空闲待分配）` |\n| **持锁会话** | - |\n\n## 二、常驻主交流总控会话\n- **当前现役总控会话**：`${CTRL_ID}`（状态：`ONLINE`）\n",
    "transcripts": {
      "${CTRL_ID}": [
        { "step_index": 0, "type": "USER_INPUT", "content": "冷启动" },
        { "step_index": 1, "type": "PLANNER_RESPONSE", "model": "gemini-4-neon-high", "status": "DONE" }
      ]
    },
    "stateJson": {
      "controllers": {
        "${CTRL_ID}": {
          "lastSyncedVersion": "1.2.2"
        }
      },
      "workers": {},
      "transcriptCache": {},
      "pendingAttention": []
    }
  },
  "action": {
    "calls": [
      {
        "eventName": "PreInvocation",
        "payload": {
          "conversationId": "${CTRL_ID}",
          "workspacePaths": ["${WORKSPACE}"],
          "lastUserInput": "继续检查任务",
          "invocationNum": 3
        },
        "expect": {
          "contains": ["[control-tower 版本同步]"],
          "flightEvent": "version_sync_notified"
        }
      },
      {
        "eventName": "PreInvocation",
        "payload": {
          "conversationId": "${CTRL_ID}",
          "workspacePaths": ["${WORKSPACE}"],
          "lastUserInput": "下一轮继续",
          "invocationNum": 4
        },
        "expect": {
          "notContains": ["[control-tower 版本同步]"]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
